      "content": "i know, i know. i've seen the numbers. but it doesn't change the fact that i'm just taking up space. it feels like i've already died, just physically i'm still walking around. like im just some extra in everyone else's movie. does that even make sense? how am i supposed to keep doing this when there's nothing left of me to actually \"live\"?",
